<template name="config-menu__layout">
    <head>
    </head>
    <body>
        <form class="config__form">
            <div class="config__wrapper">
                <div class="config-debug">
                    <div class="config-debug__scroll">
                        <div class="config-debug-option">
                            <label class="config-debug-option__label">
                                <div>HUD</div>
                            </label>
                            <div class="config-debug__option-split">
                                <div class="config-debug__option-controls">
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Remove black borders</div><div class="config-tip-text">The game leaves an eight-pixel black frame around the picture that scales up with the window; this draws the scene right to the edges instead. Applies straight away.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="enh_remove_borders" id="enh_remove_borders_select" style="nav-up: #tab_layout">
                                            <option value="0">Off</option>
                                            <option value="1">On</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper" style="align-items: flex-start;">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Layout</div><div class="config-tip-text">The box is your window and the lighter part the 4:3 picture. Drag the HP/MP block and the four spirits to where you want them on screen; each default button puts one back where the game draws it. The Notifications box shows where messages appear (set under Notifications). Applies straight away.</div></div>
                                        <div id="hud_preview" class="hud-preview">
                                            <div id="hud_area" class="hud-area"></div>
                                            <div id="hud_hp_box" class="hud-box">HP/MP</div>
                                            <div id="hud_sp_box" class="hud-box">Spirits</div>
                                            <div id="hud_notice_box" class="hud-box hud-box--notice">Notifications</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>HP/MP X / Y</div><div class="config-tip-text">The HP/MP block's position in the game's pixels: X from the window's left edge, Y from the top (the picture is 240 tall). Typing a number moves it; the drag box and these agree.</div></div>
                                        <input type="text" id="enh_hud_hp_x_input" data-value="enh_hud_hp_x" maxlength="5" style="margin-right: 8dp;" />
                                        <input type="text" id="enh_hud_hp_y_input" data-value="enh_hud_hp_y" maxlength="5" />
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Spirits X / Y</div><div class="config-tip-text">The four spirits' position in the game's pixels: X from the window's left edge, Y from the top (the picture is 240 tall). Typing a number moves them; the drag box and these agree.</div></div>
                                        <input type="text" id="enh_hud_sp_x_input" data-value="enh_hud_sp_x" maxlength="5" style="margin-right: 8dp;" />
                                        <input type="text" id="enh_hud_sp_y_input" data-value="enh_hud_sp_y" maxlength="5" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="config-debug__option-trigger">
                                    <button class="button" onclick="hud_reset_hp">HP/MP default</button>
                                    <button class="button" onclick="hud_reset_sp">Spirits default</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="config-debug-option">
                            <label class="config-debug-option__label">
                                <div>Notifications</div>
                            </label>
                            <div class="config-debug__option-split">
                                <div class="config-debug__option-controls">
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" style="font-size: 16dp; letter-spacing: 1.6dp;" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Notifications</div><div class="config-tip-text">The on-screen messages in the top-left corner. Off hides the options below and shows nothing. Applies straight away.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="enh_notifications" id="enh_notifications_select">
                                            <option value="0">Off</option>
                                            <option value="1">On</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div data-if="enh_notifications == 1">
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Position</div><div class="config-tip-text">Where the messages sit on screen. Top left shares its column with the Speedrun Timer when that is top left too. Applies straight away.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="enh_notify_position" id="enh_notify_position_select">
                                            <option value="0">Top left</option>
                                            <option value="1">Top middle</option>
                                            <option value="2">Top right</option>
                                            <option value="3">Left</option>
                                            <option value="4">Right</option>
                                            <option value="5">Middle</option>
                                            <option value="6">Bottom left</option>
                                            <option value="7">Bottom middle</option>
                                            <option value="8">Bottom right</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Never expire</div><div class="config-tip-text">Messages stay on screen instead of fading after three seconds; the oldest is pushed out when the maximum is reached. Applies straight away.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="enh_notify_never_expire" id="enh_notify_never_expire_select">
                                            <option value="0">Off</option>
                                            <option value="1">On</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-debug__select-wrapper config-option__list">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Max messages: {{enh_notify_max}}</div><div class="config-tip-text">How many messages can be on screen at once; beyond that the oldest is pushed out. Applies straight away.</div></div>
                                        <input
                                            class="nav-vert"
                                            id="enh_notify_max_input"
                                            type="range"
                                            data-value="enh_notify_max"
                                            min="1"
                                            max="10"
                                            step="1"
                                        />
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Show spell learnt</div><div class="config-tip-text">The game says nothing when a spirit takes an element to a spell's unlock level. With this on, "You have learnt ..." appears top-left for three seconds for each spell as it unlocks, using the unlock levels in play (the randomizer's level options included).</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="enh_spell_notice" id="enh_spell_notice_select">
                                            <option value="0">Off</option>
                                            <option value="1">On</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Show item received</div><div class="config-tip-text">"Received ..." appears top-left for three seconds whenever an item is added to your bag - chests, gifts, drops and shops alike.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="enh_item_notice" id="enh_item_notice_select">
                                            <option value="0">Off</option>
                                            <option value="1">On</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Speedrun Timer</div><div class="config-tip-text">Shows a run timer on screen. It starts when you leave the title screen and stops on the message that Mammon has been destroyed. Pick where on the screen it sits; messages that share the spot line up under it. Applies straight away.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="enh_speedrun_timer" id="enh_speedrun_timer_select">
                                            <option value="0">Off</option>
                                            <option value="1">Top left</option>
                                            <option value="5">Top middle</option>
                                            <option value="2">Top right</option>
                                            <option value="3">Bottom left</option>
                                            <option value="6">Bottom middle</option>
                                            <option value="4">Bottom right</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-tip"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </body>
</template>
